Greece! Man, I was trying to peg where this might have been captured in voting. I have a photo I took--nothing nearly this compelling--when my wife and I took a trip out to far west Texas in 2020 that was from about this same angle and height overlooking the Big Bend area. I had to do a double take.
<br/>
<br/>Love the composition. This was one of my top choices for the challenge.</td>', 'Greece! Man, I was trying to peg where this might have been captured in voting. I have a photo I took--nothing nearly this compelling--when my wife and I took a trip out to far west Texas in 2020 that was from about this same angle and height overlooking the Big Bend area. I had to do a double take.

Love the composition. This was one of my top choices for the challenge.', '2025-10-15 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7797789, 1300263, 12200, '<td valign="top">
